{
 "id": "seg5a",
 "title": "慢升级快暂停",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 160.31,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "知道了门怎么坏，再看钥匙怎么分。",
   "spoken": "知道了门怎么坏，再看钥匙怎么分。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.198
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "第一个原则，最小权限。把一个 owner 拆成几个角色，每个角色只做一件事。",
   "spoken": "第一个原则，最小权限。把一个 owner 拆成几个决色，每个决色只做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.252,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 5.35,
   "speechEnd": 11.097
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "升级者，负责升级实现合约。建议多签加时间锁，延迟 48 小时以上。",
   "spoken": "升级者，负责升级实现合约。建议多签加时间锁，延迟 48 小时以上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.144,
   "dur": 7.08,
   "speechStart": 12.242,
   "speechEnd": 18.37
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "参数管理员，修改费率和抵押率。建议多签加时间锁，延迟 24 小时。",
   "spoken": "参数管理员，修改费率和抵押率。建议多签加时间锁，延迟 24 小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.444,
   "dur": 7.296,
   "speechStart": 19.542,
   "speechEnd": 25.908
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "这两个数字只是示例，不是标准。",
   "spoken": "这两个数字只是示例，不是标准。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-04.mp3",
   "start": 26.96,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 27.058,
   "speechEnd": 29.486
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "暂停者，负责紧急暂停。小型多签或监控机器人就够了，不加延迟。",
   "spoken": "暂停者，负责紧急暂停。小型多签或监控机器人就够了，不加延迟。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-05.mp3",
   "start": 30.54,
   "dur": 6.864,
   "speechStart": 30.638,
   "speechEnd": 36.552
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "增发者，只授予特定的合约。",
   "spoken": "增发者，只授予特定的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-06.mp3",
   "start": 37.624,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 37.722,
   "speechEnd": 39.9
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "为什么暂停要快，升级要慢？",
   "spoken": "为什么暂停要快，升级要慢？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-07.mp3",
   "start": 40.964,
   "dur": 3.144,
   "speechStart": 41.062,
   "speechEnd": 43.288
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "暂停只能止损，转不走资金。升级可以做任何事。",
   "spoken": "暂停只能止损，转不走资金。升级可以做任何事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-08.mp3",
   "start": 44.608,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 44.706,
   "speechEnd": 49.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "第二个原则，多签加时间锁。",
   "spoken": "第二个原则，多签加时间锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-09.mp3",
   "start": 50.42,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 50.518,
   "speechEnd": 52.696
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "提案者是一个多签，比如五个人里三人签名，才能把操作交给时间锁。",
   "spoken": "提案者是一个多签，比如五个人里三人签名，才能把操作交给时间锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-10.mp3",
   "start": 53.736,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 53.834,
   "speechEnd": 58.715
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "时间锁让操作公开排队，比如 48 小时。到期之后，才能执行。",
   "spoken": "时间锁让操作公开排队，比如 48 小时。到期之后，才能执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-11.mp3",
   "start": 59.764,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 59.862,
   "speechEnd": 65.669
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "排队期间，大家都看得到。用户不同意，可以在延迟期内撤出。",
   "spoken": "排队期间，大家都看得到。用户不同意，可以在延迟期内撤出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-12.mp3",
   "start": 66.728,
   "dur": 5.904,
   "speechStart": 66.826,
   "speechEnd": 71.799
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "守护者发现恶意操作，可以取消，但不能发起。权限是不对称的。",
   "spoken": "守护者发现恶意操作，可以取消，但不能发起。权限是不对衬的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-13.mp3",
   "start": 72.852,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 72.95,
   "speechEnd": 78.34
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-14",
   "text": "这套设计也有局限。",
   "spoken": "这套设计也有局限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-14.mp3",
   "start": 79.384,
   "dur": 2.472,
   "speechStart": 79.482,
   "speechEnd": 81.005
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-15",
   "text": "多签防的是单个私钥被盗。如果所有签名人看到的，是同一个被篡改的界面，多签就挡不住。",
   "spoken": "多签防的是单个私钥被盗。如果所有签名人看到的，是同一个被篡改的界面，多签就挡不住。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-15.mp3",
   "start": 82.076,
   "dur": 8.232,
   "speechStart": 82.174,
   "speechEnd": 89.469
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-16",
   "text": "阈值还要和私钥的独立性相匹配。",
   "spoken": "阈值还要和私钥的独立性相匹配。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-16.mp3",
   "start": 90.528,
   "dur": 3.288,
   "speechStart": 90.626,
   "speechEnd": 92.995
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-17",
   "text": "2022 年 3 月的 Ronin 跨链桥，9 个验证者里，5 个签名就能放行。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 3 月的 Ronin 跨链桥，9 个验证者里，5 个签名就能放行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-17.mp3",
   "start": 94.036,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 94.134,
   "speechEnd": 99.336
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-18",
   "text": "攻击者控制了 5 把私钥。按公开复盘，其中 4 把属于同一家机构。",
   "spoken": "攻击者控制了 5 把私钥。按公开复盘，其中 4 把属于同一家机构。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-18.mp3",
   "start": 100.4,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 100.498,
   "speechEnd": 106.352
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-19",
   "text": "还有一把，来自一个早就不需要、却一直没撤销的授权。损失约 6.2 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "还有一把，来自一个早就不需要、却一直没撤销的授权。损失约 6.2 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-19.mp3",
   "start": 107.412,
   "dur": 7.128,
   "speechStart": 107.51,
   "speechEnd": 113.686
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-20",
   "text": "同年 10 月，BNB Chain 的 Token Hub 出事。",
   "spoken": "同年 10 月，BNB Chain 的 Token Hub 出事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-20.mp3",
   "start": 114.76,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 114.858,
   "speechEnd": 117.715
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-21",
   "text": "攻击者付了 100 BNB，注册成跨链中继者，再利用证明验证的缺陷，凭空铸造了 200 万 BNB。",
   "spoken": "攻击者付了 100 BNB，注册成跨链中继者，再利用证明验证的缺陷，凭空铸造了 200 万 BNB。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-21.mp3",
   "start": 118.772,
   "dur": 7.704,
   "speechStart": 118.87,
   "speechEnd": 125.632
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-22",
   "text": "Moran 硬分叉把中继者改成了白名单。",
   "spoken": "Moran 硬分岔把中继者改成了白名单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-22.mp3",
   "start": 126.696,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 126.794,
   "speechEnd": 129.71
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-23",
   "text": "只要付押金就能当中继者，这本身就是一个权限决策。",
   "spoken": "只要付押金就能当中继者，这本身就是一个权限决策。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-23.mp3",
   "start": 130.756,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 130.854,
   "speechEnd": 135.104
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-24",
   "text": "最后看 L2。谁能升级桥合约，谁就决定用户跨链资产的去向。",
   "spoken": "最后看 L2。谁能升级桥合约，谁就决定用户跨链资产的去向。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-24.mp3",
   "start": 136.16,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "speechStart": 136.258,
   "speechEnd": 142.16
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-25",
   "text": "根据 L2BEAT 截至 2026 年 11 月的页面，Mantle 的安全多签，14 人里 6 人签名，就能无延迟升级 L1 上的桥。",
   "spoken": "根据 L2BEAT 截至 2026 年 11 月的页面，Mantle 的安全多签，14 人里 6 人签名，就能无延迟升级 L1 上的桥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-25.mp3",
   "start": 143.22,
   "dur": 9.408,
   "speechStart": 143.318,
   "speechEnd": 151.806
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-26",
   "text": "这是信任假设，不是代码漏洞。但存钱之前，你应该知道它。",
   "spoken": "这是信任假设，不是代码漏洞。但存钱之前，你应该知道它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg5a-26.mp3",
   "start": 152.848,
   "dur": 6.264,
   "speechStart": 152.946,
   "speechEnd": 158.288
  }
